Package: com.hakmicapitalgroup.hcgnexus
Name: HCG Nexus
Version: 0.3.2~beta1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: HCG command panel behind a configurable cyan edge handle: Overview, Workspaces, Tools, HCG Products, Apps and Account. Command Mode shows device status and HCG integration states. Use HCG Halo border (Appearance) switches HCG Halo 0.3.1~beta1's animated panel border on or off without its screen-edge light; Nexus keeps its own outline without HCG Halo. HCG Products opens HCG Terminal and, with a Terminal build that supports it, a saved connection you then connect yourself. Off after installation; enable it in Settings > HCG Nexus. Candidate build, not yet verified on a physical device.
Maintainer: Hakmi Capital Group
Author: Hakmi Capital Group
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate | ellekit, preferenceloader
